WEBVTT

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:32.860
Fools, these humans. Greed will raise the curtain on tragedy.

00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:39.430
Moon! Will it suffice for you to but witness fear hitherto unknown?

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:43.040
Yes, it will suffice.

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:45.210
Thou beauteous goddess of the night...

00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:49.470
Hide yourself until all is ended.

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:09.830
Hey, are you sure it's safe?

00:01:09.830 --> 00:01:16.770
Yeah. In this coffin lies a treasure never seen before.

00:01:16.770 --> 00:01:21.140
But the Thieves' Code forbids opening this tomb.

00:01:21.140 --> 00:01:23.770
They say it's cursed by King Osiris.

00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:26.480
Then do what you want.

00:01:26.480 --> 00:01:29.650
But I'm taking the treasure.

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:45.930
Hey, what's inside?

00:01:48.640 --> 00:01:52.070
Hey, what the hell is this?!

00:01:52.070 --> 00:01:54.810
This isn't what they promised!

00:01:54.810 --> 00:01:58.710
Damn him! He lied to me!

00:01:58.710 --> 00:01:59.700
That bastard!

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:08.220
What'll we do? We broke the code...

00:02:08.220 --> 00:02:10.690
What'll the Guild people say?

00:02:10.690 --> 00:02:13.430
Lai, he tricked you.

00:02:13.430 --> 00:02:15.830
There's no treasure of King Osiris.

00:02:15.830 --> 00:02:17.600
Damn that bastard.

00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:19.700
With that treasure, I could've...

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:21.470
Tis and I could've....

00:02:51.370 --> 00:02:53.800
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:02:53.800 --> 00:02:57.770
<i>We dash across the skies</i>

00:02:57.770 --> 00:03:00.280
<i>You are my star</i>

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:04.780
<i>A priceless love</i>

00:03:04.780 --> 00:03:10.590
<i>El Dorado,</i> <i>rising up above the dust clouds</i>

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:14.520
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:22.630
<i>The dream I saw before I awoke</i>

00:03:22.630 --> 00:03:29.940
<i>Will surely come true, so never forget it</i>

00:03:31.410 --> 00:03:35.480
<i>Searching for a sliver in time passing by</i>

00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:42.610
<i>Where I belong, those days are over now</i>

00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:48.090
<i>Silhouettes outlining the shapes of clouds</i>

00:03:48.090 --> 00:03:50.530
<i>Farther and farther</i>

00:03:50.530 --> 00:03:57.470
<i>I want to keep looking for</i> <i>the promised land I saw in my dreams</i>

00:03:57.470 --> 00:03:59.730
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:03:59.730 --> 00:04:03.810
<i>Like a shining arrow</i>

00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:06.310
<i>You are my star</i>

00:04:06.310 --> 00:04:10.850
<i>Unfailing strength</i>

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:16.650
<i>The panorama that spreads before us,</i> <i>beyond the darkness</i>

00:04:16.650 --> 00:04:19.550
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:04:57.860 --> 00:05:00.630
I love ice cream.

00:05:00.630 --> 00:05:04.800
But just as it was in Alberta, it's always gloomy whenever I eat this.

00:05:04.800 --> 00:05:06.330
And that's because...

00:05:06.330 --> 00:05:08.300
What did you come to Morok for?!

00:05:08.300 --> 00:05:11.140
Wasn't your destination "Ant Hell"?!

00:05:12.510 --> 00:05:15.740
Never mind! If you won't leave,
I'll leave the group!

00:05:15.740 --> 00:05:17.150
Maaya!

00:05:17.150 --> 00:05:19.140
Don't talk like that!

00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:22.120
Let go of me!

00:05:22.120 --> 00:05:25.420
How can you guys stand to be with her?!

00:05:25.420 --> 00:05:28.620
We were almost killed because of her!

00:05:28.620 --> 00:05:30.860
That's true, but...

00:05:30.860 --> 00:05:32.060
Maaya-<i>chan...</i>

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:34.330
I feel the same way.

00:05:34.330 --> 00:05:35.330
Huh?

00:05:35.330 --> 00:05:38.970
I can't hang out with anyone who'll put her friends in danger.

00:05:38.970 --> 00:05:43.810
For "truth" or truffles or whatever, the most selfish ones say they're doing it

00:05:43.810 --> 00:05:46.100
"for the others," when they're only thinking of themselves!

00:05:48.540 --> 00:05:50.170
Pardon!

00:05:52.210 --> 00:05:54.210
Pardon, pardon!

00:06:02.360 --> 00:06:04.360
Big Brother Iruga?!

00:06:04.360 --> 00:06:08.560
Let's have the things you just stole.

00:06:08.560 --> 00:06:13.770
I messed up. I'm Tis, daughter of the chief of the Thieves Guild!

00:06:13.770 --> 00:06:16.640
I won't run or hide. Do what you want!

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:18.510
My purse!

00:06:18.510 --> 00:06:20.410
My doll!

00:06:20.410 --> 00:06:22.680
What do you think you're doing?!

00:06:22.680 --> 00:06:25.010
It's bad to steal from others!

00:06:25.010 --> 00:06:32.180
I know! But I need money! Money...

00:06:45.430 --> 00:06:49.170
Why are you running away?! I paid you!

00:06:49.170 --> 00:06:52.370
That's ridiculous!
This wasn't part of the deal!

00:06:52.370 --> 00:06:55.810
You never said there'd be monsters in the pyramid!

00:06:55.810 --> 00:06:58.810
This wasn't our agreement!
The contract is void!

00:06:58.810 --> 00:07:01.920
But I've got to find Lai!

00:07:01.920 --> 00:07:05.510
Then bring more money! Money!

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:13.390
Aren't you a thief?

00:07:13.390 --> 00:07:16.330
The Thieves Guild is in the pyramid.

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:21.100
Why should you form a band just to go inside?

00:07:21.100 --> 00:07:24.070
The pyramid is full of monsters now.

00:07:24.070 --> 00:07:25.140
--Huh?
--Huh?

00:07:25.140 --> 00:07:30.950
It's because Lai broke the Thieves' Code and awakened King Osiris.

00:07:30.950 --> 00:07:32.250
Who's Lai?

00:07:32.250 --> 00:07:34.680
He's my... boyfriend...

00:07:34.680 --> 00:07:37.810
Huh? You've got a boyfriend?

00:07:39.090 --> 00:07:40.720
Who's King Osiris?

00:07:40.720 --> 00:07:45.360
He was a monarch who ruled over the land that was once in Morok.

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:48.930
They say he ruled wisely and was greatly loved by his people.

00:07:48.930 --> 00:07:50.770
No one asked you!

00:07:51.470 --> 00:07:56.670
I wanted to know why Lai broke the code.

00:07:56.670 --> 00:08:00.710
Everyone in the Guild said he did it for the treasure of Osiris,

00:08:00.710 --> 00:08:03.040
but Lai isn't that sort of person!

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:05.450
I just know that guy tricked him!

00:08:05.450 --> 00:08:06.710
"That guy"?

00:08:06.710 --> 00:08:09.350
Yes. I saw him.

00:08:09.350 --> 00:08:13.410
Before Lai went into the pyramid,
I saw him talking with a masked man!

00:08:15.390 --> 00:08:17.650
A masked man...

00:08:22.530 --> 00:08:26.400
Don't worry, Tis. We'll go with you.

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:28.670
Huh? B-But...

00:08:28.670 --> 00:08:30.070
Are you going, too, Iruga?

00:08:30.070 --> 00:08:33.040
Then I'll have to go, too.

00:08:33.040 --> 00:08:35.310
I'll go, too, Tis-<i>chan.</i>

00:08:40.820 --> 00:08:42.950
Are you two lovers?

00:08:42.950 --> 00:08:45.050
Oh, uh...

00:08:45.050 --> 00:08:46.990
No, we're not.

00:08:46.990 --> 00:08:48.850
I'll go with you.

00:08:50.260 --> 00:08:53.360
I can't ignore people who need my help.

00:08:53.360 --> 00:08:56.830
Are you going to put us all in danger again?

00:08:56.830 --> 00:09:01.600
No, I simply must help this girl

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:04.070
--whose hired help abandoned her...
--Well, never mind.

00:09:04.070 --> 00:09:06.510
Yuufa's "Heal" is pretty effective,

00:09:06.510 --> 00:09:09.510
but we really need
Takius's magic, after all.

00:09:09.510 --> 00:09:12.670
But if you should ever try anything funny again...

00:09:14.320 --> 00:09:16.440
I'll take you out myself.

00:09:28.130 --> 00:09:30.970
First, we'll have to rescue everyone in the Thieves Guild.

00:09:30.970 --> 00:09:33.230
It's a maze inside the pyramid,

00:09:33.230 --> 00:09:35.200
so be careful not to get separated from the group.

00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:52.520
This way.

00:09:52.520 --> 00:09:53.510
Wait!

00:09:58.060 --> 00:10:01.690
Minotaurus!! I didn't think he'd be here!

00:10:05.970 --> 00:10:07.160
Hey!

00:10:09.970 --> 00:10:11.370
Snap out of it!

00:10:25.150 --> 00:10:26.750
Yay!

00:10:29.390 --> 00:10:31.790
I think it was too soon to rejoice.

00:10:31.790 --> 00:10:33.360
Huh?

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:36.420
The wall is... crumbling.

00:10:40.900 --> 00:10:43.770
Let's hurry to the Thieves Guild!

00:10:43.770 --> 00:10:47.710
Hey... You... Wait a minute!

00:11:02.890 --> 00:11:04.290
Iruga!

00:11:12.330 --> 00:11:14.890
Damn! We've all been separated...

00:11:16.600 --> 00:11:20.810
Yuufa! Tis-<i>chan</i>! Let me handle this! Run!

00:11:20.810 --> 00:11:26.110
Huh. I thought he was kind of slow, but your boyfriend's pretty dependable.

00:11:26.110 --> 00:11:28.750
He's not my boyfriend.

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:30.620
Just get away, will you?!

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:38.360
Should we just leave him like that?

00:11:38.360 --> 00:11:39.790
He'll be fine.

00:11:59.080 --> 00:12:02.480
I'm all alone with you, of all people...

00:12:04.550 --> 00:12:08.920
Poi-poi, if anything should happen to me, tell everyone the true story, now!

00:12:08.920 --> 00:12:10.410
Poring!

00:12:17.260 --> 00:12:18.970
Where are we?

00:12:18.970 --> 00:12:21.200
This is the Thieves Guild.

00:12:31.350 --> 00:12:34.580
Thunder... Storm!

00:12:45.160 --> 00:12:47.190
Who are you?

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:53.930
Champions of justice at your service!

00:12:53.930 --> 00:12:55.840
Recovery items, foodstuff, all necessities!

00:12:55.840 --> 00:12:58.140
All available at your request!

00:12:58.140 --> 00:13:00.370
We're friends of Tis-<i>san.</i>

00:13:00.370 --> 00:13:01.840
Tis?

00:13:03.680 --> 00:13:04.980
Heal!

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:13.350
We make a good team, don't we?

00:13:13.350 --> 00:13:19.590
Yes. Still... Where are we, anyway?

00:13:19.590 --> 00:13:21.820
I don't know, either.

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:29.130
Welcome! To the stage of despair and hatred!

00:13:32.710 --> 00:13:34.240
You!

00:13:34.240 --> 00:13:35.800
Big Brother?

00:13:48.990 --> 00:13:50.830
Big Brother...

00:13:50.830 --> 00:13:52.760
You dirty...

00:13:52.760 --> 00:13:55.330
Stop, Tis!

00:13:55.330 --> 00:13:56.760
Huh?

00:13:56.760 --> 00:13:59.830
Big Brother?! You're my Big Brother, aren't you?!

00:14:01.570 --> 00:14:06.140
Your Big Brother... I killed him.

00:14:06.140 --> 00:14:08.210
Huh?

00:14:08.210 --> 00:14:14.850
Rather, I saved him.
Just as I did to that girl's lover!

00:14:14.850 --> 00:14:19.550
I knew it... You were the one!

00:14:19.550 --> 00:14:24.460
I'm to blame for everything.

00:14:24.460 --> 00:14:28.900
I knew Lai and Tis were seeing each other.

00:14:28.900 --> 00:14:34.800
But being the Chief, I couldn't approve of their marriage.

00:14:34.800 --> 00:14:38.470
I said they were too young, and their skills were yet incomplete.

00:14:38.470 --> 00:14:41.940
So Lai committed an act of desperation.

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:44.450
The boy was overjoyed.

00:14:44.450 --> 00:14:48.080
He said he'd be able to marry you now.

00:14:48.080 --> 00:14:50.320
H-How terrible.

00:14:50.320 --> 00:14:53.490
So Lai broke the Thieves' Code for my sake?

00:14:53.490 --> 00:14:57.220
Good grief, all people can do is think of themselves.

00:14:57.220 --> 00:15:00.360
He was unaware that his act prompted by greed

00:15:00.360 --> 00:15:03.860
would turn his world into a living hell.

00:15:03.860 --> 00:15:06.570
I wish you could have seen it....

00:15:06.570 --> 00:15:11.510
How the joy in his face was transformed into dashed hope.

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:15.070
Just as... you look right now!

00:15:17.110 --> 00:15:18.100
Tis!

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:24.950
The greater the expectations, the greater the tragedy.

00:15:24.950 --> 00:15:28.760
Trusting is what fools do.

00:15:28.760 --> 00:15:30.250
What?!

00:15:40.430 --> 00:15:44.940
Come, I shall send you to your brother.

00:15:44.940 --> 00:15:48.540
Death alone is your salvation.

00:15:48.540 --> 00:15:53.780
Why? Because you'll be spared from seeing the hell that is about to begin.

00:15:55.920 --> 00:15:57.380
They...

00:15:57.380 --> 00:15:59.050
The Monsters have appeared!!

00:16:14.100 --> 00:16:16.600
Come...

00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:17.940
Yuufa!

00:16:19.070 --> 00:16:20.560
Stop!

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:24.910
Don't you touch Yuufa!

00:16:24.910 --> 00:16:25.900
Roan!

00:16:31.450 --> 00:16:33.250
Bastard...

00:16:47.670 --> 00:16:49.100
Roan!

00:16:54.310 --> 00:16:58.280
Is that your best effort?

00:16:58.280 --> 00:17:03.480
With such strength... can you protect Yuufa?

00:17:04.990 --> 00:17:07.390
Look after Yuufa.

00:17:08.960 --> 00:17:11.990
You have no strength to protect her.

00:17:11.990 --> 00:17:16.620
For men without strength, there is only despair!

00:17:20.630 --> 00:17:21.570
Stop!

00:17:21.570 --> 00:17:22.730
Big Brother!

00:17:28.810 --> 00:17:30.280
Lai!

00:17:30.280 --> 00:17:33.210
You put me through hell!

00:17:33.210 --> 00:17:35.420
Quite the tenacious one.

00:17:35.420 --> 00:17:37.020
You're still alive?

00:17:38.590 --> 00:17:40.210
Cold Bolt!

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:43.720
--Yay! She did it!
--Yay! She did it!
--Yay! She did it!

00:17:50.930 --> 00:17:53.870
Thunder Storm!

00:18:03.880 --> 00:18:07.650
I don't trust you.

00:18:07.650 --> 00:18:10.950
It's my job to see that you don't betray us.

00:18:27.800 --> 00:18:30.700
You tricked me!

00:18:31.910 --> 00:18:35.380
It's your fault for allowing yourself to be tricked.

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:37.040
What?!

00:18:44.820 --> 00:18:46.220
Lai!

00:18:46.220 --> 00:18:47.120
Are you all right?!

00:18:47.120 --> 00:18:48.110
Lai!

00:18:49.960 --> 00:18:54.520
Come... I'll grant your wish.

00:18:57.870 --> 00:18:59.670
Yuufa! What's wrong?!

00:18:59.670 --> 00:19:01.340
Yuufa, run!!

00:19:01.340 --> 00:19:05.200
I'll show you the other side of the mirror of truth.

00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:10.340
I'll protect Yuufa!

00:19:17.890 --> 00:19:21.520
Yuu... fa...

00:19:21.520 --> 00:19:27.560
I told you... men without strength have only despair!

00:19:27.560 --> 00:19:28.930
You think so?

00:19:32.400 --> 00:19:33.700
You!

00:19:36.070 --> 00:19:37.970
Big Brother Iruga!

00:19:37.970 --> 00:19:39.410
Stay back.

00:19:43.880 --> 00:19:46.570
Hey! Pull yourself together!

00:19:49.420 --> 00:19:53.150
Judia-<i>san</i>... Tis-<i>chan</i>!

00:19:53.150 --> 00:19:54.520
Where's Yuufa?!

00:20:05.830 --> 00:20:08.670
Can't you hear it, Iruga?

00:20:08.670 --> 00:20:11.810
The trembling voices of the departed...

00:20:11.810 --> 00:20:17.010
Soon the world will be filled with the joyous cries of the dead.

00:20:17.010 --> 00:20:22.520
You and your friends are only struggling in vain...

00:20:22.520 --> 00:20:24.380
Let me show you!

00:20:48.110 --> 00:20:50.480
--Iruga!
--Big Brother Iruga!

00:21:05.390 --> 00:21:06.760
Big Brother...

00:21:06.760 --> 00:21:08.430
Are you all right, Iruga?!

00:21:08.430 --> 00:21:10.090
It's only a scratch.

00:21:23.080 --> 00:21:24.410
Osiris!

00:21:27.880 --> 00:21:28.880
What's this?!

00:21:28.880 --> 00:21:30.780
How can we get away?!

00:21:33.820 --> 00:21:36.420
The party of terror has begun!

00:21:37.420 --> 00:21:38.450
What's that?!

00:21:48.070 --> 00:21:51.160
What is this?

00:21:53.510 --> 00:21:55.600
Withdraw.

00:21:58.680 --> 00:22:01.580
We'll abandon the Thieves Guild!

00:22:02.520 --> 00:22:05.450
Withdraw, everyone!!

00:22:12.560 --> 00:22:15.260
Wh-What is it... that you want?!

00:22:34.920 --> 00:22:44.910
<i>Unable to even find a way</i> <i>to regain the strength we lost</i>

00:22:45.890 --> 00:22:54.000
<i>Here we are, beneath this vast sky</i>

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:58.840
<i>The shining cradle of green</i>

00:22:58.840 --> 00:23:03.710
<i>Is a merry-go-round</i> <i>that will never stop turning</i>

00:23:03.710 --> 00:23:08.480
<i>Greater than any jewel in this world</i>

00:23:08.480 --> 00:23:12.820
<i>It is a precious treasure</i>

00:23:12.820 --> 00:23:22.820
<i>The endless journey leads to our tomorrow</i>

00:23:31.740 --> 00:23:32.970
<i>This is Binit.</i>

00:23:32.970 --> 00:23:34.610
<i>Emergency, emergency!</i>

00:23:34.610 --> 00:23:36.610
<i>A massive outbreak of Monsters</i> <i>has occurred in Morok!</i>

00:23:36.610 --> 00:23:39.810
<i>The help of all available</i> <i>adventurers is requested!</i>

00:23:39.810 --> 00:23:42.720
<i>Next time,</i> "All Is Only Despair."

00:23:42.720 --> 00:23:45.190
<i>You'll come to save us, won't you?</i>
